          "type": "text",
          "text": "Student designers considered frequent handling during training while preparing a replacement design for the evacuation centre supply bin. Supply packages are counted before every emergency exercise. A later inspection will compare the finished dimensions with this record. A cone has radius 4 cm and perpendicular height 12 cm. Find its volume in cm³, correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
